                                                "sense_id": "8ef0b1de-ea28-3b68-a4e2-7887f6adca7a",
                                                "text": "[J]ust before the rhythm becomes iambic, there will be a point reached at which the rhythm can hardly be said to be more iambic than it is trochaic."
